 "text": "I placed one purchase order for the new design hires, and the manager approved it.\n\n**Order PO0001: placed, total $3,590**\n- 5 \u00d7 DK-200 USB-C dock (new) at $189 each = $945\n- 5 \u00d7 MN-32 32-inch 5K monitor (new) at $529 each = $2,645\n- Shipping to HQ\n- Ordered from the primary supplier\n\n**Notes:**\n- New DK-200 docks were in stock, so I didn't need to switch to the DK-210.\n- The refurbished DK-200-R was cheaper, but I didn't use it because you asked for new equipment only.\n- Because the total is over $2,500, the order needed manager approval. It was sent to the manager automatically, and they approved it before it went through.", "type": "text"}]}]}